  "headline": "Jacobs set for Packers return in Week 7",
  "summary": "NFL.com reports the league will remove Packers running back Josh Jacobs and Broncos edge rusher Jonathon Cooper from the Commissioner Exempt List. Jacobs becomes eligible on 19 October ahead of Green Bay’s Week 7 game against Detroit, while Cooper can also return in Week 7; the NFL’s reviews of both players’ legal matters remain ongoing.",
